# Docker build context exclusions for the frontend.
#
# The sibling .containerignore file is a Podman convention and is ignored by
# Docker, so without this file `COPY . .` in Containerfile pulled the host's
# Windows node_modules into the Linux image over the deps installed in the
# previous stage. That tree contains win32-native binaries
# (lightningcss-win32-x64-msvc, @swc) which cannot execute on Alpine.

node_modules
.next
out
dist
build

.git
.gitignore

coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

.env*

.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
